": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8gdx3BPvWRgQ7kNvwHYE183&_nc_oc=Adq5ndAMPuYc3b1OVq1UaUxAp6U9HKz3Fk-EQyhSxiiOP-8jSBivTKgb_xex2GHXwa8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKQb9vXI-CPS8xXP7OjuNCpgw8UsnZSGqSutfPRg9rDOQ&oe=6A98499B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BCDSvtN59OMQ7kNvwGp-e0E&_nc_oc=AdrqYBqE0rQ6xxVPpDrxx8dFfKLagtBZM2wvJ7ciS3-Ad9PJAL7HkcHSGziWuZtS6L8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI-nBoIfR1f45lsty3xOX93DK8C9BTHjbBesAabLwJpZw&oe=6A9839E1"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BiN1gGiz_zoQ7kNvwGaEsc4&_nc_oc=Adp1Pl4sOV4TR9ucPRPUjzRRoHjxN9jk3gqzQMIsLto7U3NZ17vuXndb1qUmBHvA6wY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLGOyFglCzdX8PSofMxiO7dsPH11pnOGy7PjG5wnQh8iA&oe=6A985EEF"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PK4cypOl0KUQ7kNvwFwYiip&_nc_oc=AdpRhV0lPNqcv2oDyZGf86BpN_JcXdhDVsTJoZ4TZ1tiaOgu9L3X3b3GZUt47oTNZVM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJZTEvaljH9VGKs61ohIrnObMIof1QfTe3tsvoXVwktGA&oe=6A985E92"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xuP-lrcBHEUQ7kNvwH6tQTy&_nc_oc=AdqY0SdbKkdnrjD95lPxqFIm9y-3_kmGUsiTKRII4ZuaqKoouLJId1rF8rsYKE6oLek&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJgI9BgaYO7rTOAIuXKSKP0InUsx8QU1RYxNCcOti22ug&oe=6A98683D"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a